@host = http://localhost:5192

# Ejecuta iam.http con una cuenta ROLE_FARMER antes de probar el plan SEED.

### Listar planes
GET {{host}}/api/v1/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{iamToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar mi suscripción
GET {{host}}/api/v1/subscriptions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{iamToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Simular un pago rechazado
POST {{host}}/api/v1/subscriptions/me/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{iamToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planCode": "SEED", "billingCycle": "MONTHLY", "simulatedOutcome": "REJECTED" }

### Simular un pago aprobado
POST {{host}}/api/v1/subscriptions/me/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{iamToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planCode": "SEED", "billingCycle": "MONTHLY", "simulatedOutcome": "COMPLETED" }
